\p
\v 1 \add Back\add* in¦123781 the¦123781 time¦123781 when the tribal¦123783 leaders¦123783 ruled \add Yisrael (Israel)\add*, there was¦123780 \add a drought which caused\add* a shortage¦123785 of food¦123790, so a man¦123788 from¦123789 \add the town of\add* Beyt¦123789-Lehem¦123789 \add !(Bethlehem¦123789)\add* in the Yehudah¦123791 \add !(Judah¦123791) region¦123793\add* went¦123787 to¦123792 live¦123792 in¦123793 the¦123793 country¦123793 of¦123793 Moab¦123794 \add for a while\add*, taking his¦123796 wife¦123796 and¦123780 their two¦123797 sons¦123798.
