\v 6 \add One day\add* Naomi was in the¦123865 countryside¦123869 there in Moab¦123866 when she¦123868 heard¦123868 someone telling about¦123863 how Yahweh¦123874 had helped his¦123877 people¦123877 in Yisrael and¦123861 that¦123871 now they had¦123873 plenty of¦123877 food¦123880, so she got ready to return¦123864 \add to Beyt-Lehem\add* with¦123869 her¦123863 \add two\add* daughters-in-law¦123863.
