\v 11 But¦123945 Naomi¦123946 responded¦123945, “No, go¦123950 back¦123947 to¦123949 your homes my¦123956 daughters¦123948. Why would¦123950 you¦123950 bother coming with¦123956 me¦123951? It's¦123945 not like I could still¦123952 give birth to¦123954 \add more\add* sons¦123955 to¦123958 become your husbands¦123959.
