\v 8 So¦124279 Boaz¦124280 \add approached\add* Ruth¦124283, “Young woman,” he¦124279 said¦124279, “listen¦124285 here. Don't¦124284 leave¦124289 this¦124296 place or go¦124289 to¦124290 any other field¦124291 to pick up grain, but¦124279 just¦124296 stay¦124298 close by these young¦124301 female¦124301 workers of¦124301 mine.
