\c 3
\s1 Ruth requests Boaz to assume his responsibilities
\rem /s1 Ruth at the Threshing Floor; Ruth and Boaz at the Threshing Floor; Ruth Finds a Husband
\p
\v 1 One day Ruth's mother-in-law¦124632 Naomi¦124631 said¦124629 to¦124630 her¦124632, “My¦124633 daughter¦124633, I think I need to be finding a secure living situation for¦124637 you?
\v 2 Now¦124644, Boaz¦124646 whose¦124652 servant¦124652 girls you've been working with¦124650, he's¦124655 a relative¦124647 of¦124647 ours. In¦124653 fact, he'll¦124655 be¦124656 on the¦124659 threshing¦124659 floor¦124659 winnowing¦124656 barley¦124660 tonight.
\v 3 So¦124663 wash¦124663 yourself¦124675 and put¦124666 on¦124669 some perfume. Wear your¦124667 cloak and¦124670 go¦124670 out to¦124676 the¦124672 threshing¦124672 floor¦124672, but¦124663 don't¦124673 let him know¦124675 you're there until¦124677 he's¦124678 finished¦124678 eating¦124679 and¦124680 drinking¦124680.
\v 4 Then when¦124683 he¦124683 lies¦124683 down¦124683 \add to sleep\add*, pay attention to where¦124688 he¦124689 lies down¦124689. \add Once he's asleep,\add* go¦124692 and lift the¦124687 blanket near his¦124694 feet¦124694 and lie¦124689 down. Then he'll¦124689 tell¦124698 you¦124702 what to do¦124702 \add next\add*.”
\p
\v 5 “I'll¦124712 do¦124712 everything you¦124710 say,” Ruth answered¦124705,
\v 6 then¦124714 she¦124714 went¦124714 out to¦124717 the¦124715 threshing¦124715 floor¦124715 and¦124716 did¦124716 everything her¦124721 mother-in-law¦124721 had¦124720 instructed¦124720.
\p
\v 7 When¦124723 Boaz¦124724 had finished¦124730 eating¦124723 and¦124725 drinking¦124725 and¦124726 was¦124726 feeling cheery, he¦124728 went¦124728 off to¦124729 lie¦124729 down¦124729 at¦124730 the¦124730 end¦124730 of¦124730 the¦124731 pile¦124731 of grain¦124731. Then¦124723 Ruth quietly¦124733 followed him, and¦124734 uncovered¦124734 his¦124735 feet¦124735 and¦124736 lay¦124736 down¦124736 \add there\add*.
\v 8 But¦124738 Boaz¦124744 was startled¦124741 in¦124739 the¦124739 middle¦124739 of¦124739 the¦124740 night¦124740, and¦124738 when he turned¦124743 over he¦124743 was stunned to find a woman¦124745 lying¦124746 at¦124739 his¦124747 feet¦124747.
